{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "e96e9f09d7d7bd10e13746a56f1ca9185122e311774b93f93bcaafc372de287b", "ja": "星の光にあこがれて☆", "zh": "憧憬星光☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e98a0f0ede84afd3307bc8c9983d61bb5f1b909020a818a554f708efc69f1514", "ja": "夜空に輝く星をテーマにした公演をする事に\nなった星梨花達。星といえば今週末に流星群\nがピークを迎えるらしい。みんなで見に行こ\nうとなるが、星梨花の父は門限に厳しい。\n未来はそんな父を説得すると張り切る。", "zh": "星梨花等人将以夜空中闪耀的星星为主题进行\n公演，而说到星星，流星雨的高峰期似乎就在\n这个周末。大家决定一起去观星，但是星梨花\n的爸爸对门禁要求很严。\n未来鼓足了干劲想说服她爸爸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6a90c9e14a9073a280093b374c69cf181168d0e86eff40448a59521c9860f5ed", "ja": "（いよいよ『Starlight Melody!』公演の\nテーマ曲『Starry Melody』の初披露だ！）", "zh": "（『Starlight Melody!』公演的主题曲\n『Starry Melody』终于要首次亮相！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "45d4c0948de60e2c9fc938ccb05da34e6467c3d812364af082ed25a003c668ce", "ja": "（まずは、今回の公演でこの曲を担当する5人に\n集まってもらった。みんな、待ちきれなさそうだ）", "zh": "（我先请这次公演中负责唱这首歌曲的五个人集合了。\n大家感觉都要等不及了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "55dbaae772dee3140806b3aadfad8cd4e6f8209797102e897aace2131acbe5ad", "ja": "わたし達が歌う曲、『Starry Melody』……。\nどんな曲か、とっても楽しみです！", "zh": "我们要唱的这首『Starry Melody』……\n究竟是什么样的歌呢，好期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "cc0c51effe453a4185895501d46c8b8b74d966305da28e1e23b48b8fe27b3c1c", "ja": "えっと、プレイヤーの再生ボタンは……。", "zh": "我看看，播放器的播放键在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "8834a012009438a88b7ea4639d5e1993a509ef3002a6dca871e05843f7e34e29", "ja": "これですよね？\nそれじゃ、新曲スタート！　ぽちっ♪", "zh": "是这个吧？\n那么，新歌开始！我按♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1005_se", "source_sha256": "8dbdaaf9fa5b3221449dede8e7732645650a42a358afdb656efcd16df01f9207", "ja": "ウィーン", "zh": "（唰）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e96ff964de0e2ccb4dc243bf950e56128d28b07ba9adeacafbad765d693ccd7d", "ja": "ふふっ、CDが出てきちゃったね。\nそっちはイジェクトボタンだったみたい。", "zh": "呵呵，CD退出来了呢。\n那个好像是退出键。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "deba4fb4a87c9f8ae6fb8df766f3429eef2971883c754246d39e621696561bd0", "ja": "真っ白いCDにマジックでタイトルが書かれて……。\nふぉぉぉ！　これこそ未公開のプレミアもの！", "zh": "全白的CD上有麦克笔写的标题……\n唔喔喔喔！这可是未公开的宝物级CD！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "750adfd6b9dfa58b0827aa0ccfaf3b261578945fe7e317ab43f39b6b7d32918b", "ja": "いい加減に慣れてくれよ、亜利沙。\nとにかく、あらためて聞いてみよう！", "zh": "亚利沙，你也差不多该习惯了吧。\n总之先来听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "3760ea621dfe7fd3f8b31f9fd564594755be52232d39dddedfea71985b87048c", "ja": "わあ～、カワイイ曲！\nね、カワイイよね、星梨花！", "zh": "哇啊～好可爱的歌！\n星梨花，很可爱对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "41ddd371135ec327a9b3b1f6e5ef90534f756b1dc50c3fe8dd8520f470896be1", "ja": "はい！　まるで夜空を、お星さまと一緒に\n飛んでるみたいな……、素敵な曲ですね♪", "zh": "对啊！仿佛在夜空中跟星星一起飞行……\n是一首很棒的曲子呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "5b14671492e0213d25efee92c2c9fbc2361735bf9e911791b8052d60ff95ce4e", "ja": "メロディも楽しくて、とってもにぎやかで。\nキラキラと星が飛び交う情景が浮かびました！", "zh": "旋律也很愉快，感觉相当热闹。\n我已能想像星星在空中交错飞舞的闪耀情景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "bed93eba7feba2bcfd01b5b6aa5976ec9e29d78d3bfedb1d236d346d13a0c024", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\nちょうどいいから、みんなで星を見ませんか！？", "zh": "对了！{$P$}先生，\n时机正好，要不要大家一起去看星星！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "72b21eb62f1e2cd26ca97f9ec1471fee0292bdfbe2f5bdd910e635b0599238b9", "ja": "星か……星？　\n星の話を、最近どこかで聞いたような……？", "zh": "星星啊……星星？\n我最近好像也在哪听过这个话题……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "2a1bc5baeaf109a0d7bb0c73f603e31a8e1305cacb1a504f5cd2e7619c8f4ff3", "ja": "あ、ミリオン流星群のことじゃないですか？\nありさ、ニュースで見ました！", "zh": "啊，会不会是在说百万流星雨？\n亚利沙在新闻上有看到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fdafc06e66846a240c2924be78769124b64593db010efe090811b1853c923ea5", "ja": "それだ！　音無さんも言ってたんだよ。\nミリオン流星群って、そんなに有名だったのか。", "zh": "就是它！音无小姐之前也有提到。\n原来百万流星雨这么有名啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "dadb3f8608f60d5bfc4cb0e0f963e5d4040bb6545035f6d9acb43bddae7ce81f", "ja": "それはもう！　100万の星が降り注ぐという\n超大型流星群だそうですから♪", "zh": "当然啊！那可是据说是有一百万颗星星\n会一起掉落的超大型流星雨耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "955308120e4867aa67976b65c177bfd09b6161c2168c9545ddbb2ec36788d84f", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n流星群って、なんですか？", "zh": "不好意思，{$P$}先生，\n请问流星雨是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "21cef718ba0362f807f2fd12ce86b682d6dcdbb527851a2eeeb2165fb059109e", "ja": "流星群っていうのは、簡単に言うと……\n流れ星がたくさん夜空に流れることなんだ。", "zh": "所谓的流星雨，简单来说就是指……\n有很多流星一起划过夜空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "8dcfcf6a588bbd99cb443fbfe96fc05ea0dad44119a1e749e8c32cb23530b9af", "ja": "あのね星梨花、もうすぐ空一面に、\nいっぱいいーっぱい、流れ星が降ってくるんだって！", "zh": "跟你说喔，星梨花，听说再过不久，\n就会有很多很──多流星掉下来，布满整片天空喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "11ff247e35d6a89169095f1ee2bd77b260e9fbdb38adb63edc212cec06db8131", "ja": "空一面……！　すごいです！\n未来さん、わたしも流星群、見たいです！", "zh": "整片天空……！好棒喔！\n未来姊姊，我也想要看流星雨！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "33eb63fe727ea2ee5c7b53b8d876c68a4c523f052c4dbf358f16133a6ca89d06", "ja": "そうだよね！\n{$P$}さん、私も見たいです！", "zh": "对吧！\n{$P$}先生，我也想看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "0f15527b4f319ec5f77371d22cbd2d5b7898d1b301b8e108d9d65e2c77d2474f", "ja": "ありさも見たいです！　流れ星を見て感動している\n星梨花ちゃんと未来ちゃんを、ぜひとも見たいです！", "zh": "亚利沙也想看！亚利沙一定要看看\n星梨花跟未来看流星时的感动模样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ef9057cc57777632c3f73fa7232c4d842f8401b54c2c35610f3b33247801741e", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\n正直でいいぞ、亜利沙！", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n诚实是好事，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "65425e0d609bdf4e519571225d2e18dfc964a64dde7d46ac873ee84f348cd193", "ja": "劇場の屋上からなら、星空も見やすそうですね。\nでも、空一面の流れ星は無理かな……？", "zh": "从剧场屋顶上应该可以清楚看到星空吧。\n不过可能没办法看到满天的流星……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b857f5aeac26f27654f86a3107d523c1e18fe35d8d7d9557ee5a1737f8301876", "ja": "そうだね、この辺りは街の明かりもあるから。本当は\nもっと暗くて、見晴らしのいいところがいいんだって。", "zh": "是呀，因为这附近还有街上的灯光。\n听说最好是到更暗、视野更好的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e2c68cda6ce31e8f66cdceeee9e74094e10d246be846d3a36cb13c84753bd59", "ja": "え～。そうなんだ……。", "zh": "咦～原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "ef458344421150bcfb5ec64b6a7f5addbbf3a45b3fc55c290b857dc62e2a68d0", "ja": "ふっふっふ。未来ちゃん星梨花ちゃん、安心して\nください。ありさの情報網に死角はありませんよ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，未来跟星梨花，请你们放心。\n亚利沙的情报网是没有死角的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "ade76ca8655a77a32f1bf76a24a14fe641a3710b16028a2828481fc5b4f135c4", "ja": "ありさ、育ちゃんからリサーチ済みなんです。\n山から見る満天の星空は、最高にキレイだそうですよ！", "zh": "亚利沙已经从小育那里调查完毕了。\n听说从山上看见的满天星斗是最漂亮的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "5b49f48a825306e98157603eb89d801bac80d86473180e87d25f99b53a02dfe3", "ja": "これはもう、行くしかありません！　行きましょう！\n流星群とアイドルちゃんの観測のために！", "zh": "既然这样就非去不可了！我们走吧！\n为了观测流星雨跟偶像宝贝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "bd38b2fb0d3f5761f66b274c7e1c66b8fab1a06e03dc376bd7fb40c575fe27ff", "ja": "ま、待って亜利沙！　山で星を見るって言っても、\n行くのは真夜中になるのよ？", "zh": "等、等一下亚利沙！你说要去山上看星星，\n但别忘了是在半夜喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "c9331f1461f85ed522cf27f10256f9bba69abe3ace428bf09c06dbd63890d43b", "ja": "ちゃんと親御さんの許可を取らないと。\n亜利沙もだけど、未来も……星梨花ちゃんも。", "zh": "必须先取得家长的同意才行。\n不只是亚利沙，未来也是……还有星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "b76bc6f4e8218b667f6cff69ca3bf7f1abcb0d2690651718f6e1c675bb2852d8", "ja": "星梨花？", "zh": "星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "5fb4a9a34d1cdeb9af4c3aacd3c03a5f91d8cdc394ce8d152d2c16254e1cee34", "ja": "そ……そうですね。真夜中のお出かけなんて、\nありさはともかく、みなさんは、そう簡単には……。", "zh": "说……说的也是呢。要在半夜出门，先不说亚利沙，\n对大家来说也没那么简单……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "c0bdddd3f2262a9c7bade38e919ab6b9b29540f8265dc2beeb656f19380d32e1", "ja": "はい……。きっとパパは、危ないからダメって言うと\n思います。わたし、もう子どもじゃないのに……。", "zh": "是啊……我爸爸一定会说太危险了不准去。\n明明我已经不是小孩子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "21f094a53b400f2041019a06355447ff3939b9c012df52bc6e00bb818ae805b1", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "063911eacdc35b6b0ab9382c2f59e1fa7b76db7d2201d8dc0db4d9efbaf14cf6", "ja": "（星梨花のお父さんは、普段の活動でも門限に厳しい。\n夜の山なんて、行かせてもらえないか……）", "zh": "（就连平时的活动，星梨花的爸爸对门禁要求也很严。\n他大概不会同意让她晚上到山上去吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "5b9bf76f089571d7a021845a397ae20dcbd21b3c43d2e402f1d86a4f958c6ae1", "ja": "すみません！　ありさ余計なコト言っちゃいました。\nそ、そうそう、プラネタリウムもいいんですよ～？？", "zh": "对不起！都是亚利沙多嘴。\n对、对了，天象馆也是很不错的喔～？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "56a929ede157924c70cb27917e0648872871f9b4cf3d938fdd5734550aa95b10", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、星梨花！", "zh": "不用担心，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "59fca466b17961b3c9780ebfcf5d115ee4ecf15a548f1bffa28451afa25e8490", "ja": "えっ？　み、未来さん？", "zh": "咦？未、未来姊姊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "5b49e38c432d5d856500297a769cc453d0ebac36d3e77a1b01346e4305f5d0ce", "ja": "未来……？", "zh": "未来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "6bfef8c552bc7eb9779e79de4328118f96c2c7d5ed2df4598e545fe499e1f556", "ja": "私も、星梨花のパパさんにお願いするから！\n流星群、星梨花と一緒に見せてくださいって。", "zh": "我也会去拜托星梨花的爸爸的！\n拜托他说，请让星梨花跟我们一起去看流星雨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1047_014mir", "source_sha256": "0c0fff3ed0e0aa5fddeb807fd67dfe77b5c542f283b587d071ca609108f5391f", "ja": "すぐには無理かもしれないけど、\n一生懸命お願いしたら、根負けしてくれるかも！", "zh": "一时半刻应该没办法，\n不过只要我拚命拜托，伯父说不定会松口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1048_022ser", "source_sha256": "cff8c1f91a3a10a8dab5abef2b1da48c23789bd800ccf13b1bc5d47b5c38123d", "ja": "未来さん……。", "zh": "未来姊姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0d596735aedbea5fc934986d86393b5f18107a01c331fbbfb8fe6907e2943d67", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さん。\n私たち大人も一緒だってわかれば、もしかしたら……？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，如果\n星梨花的爸爸知道有我们这些成年人陪同，说不定……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "c57575d4dd6671dd14b7908d9314719da94c29ddc7dcbcc3d75a9751046b9e56", "ja": "どうだろうな。もちろん俺もお願いに行くけど……。\nいや、そうだ。……風花だよ、風花！", "zh": "这很难说，当然我也会一起去拜托他就是了……\n不对，我想到了……风花，我要拜托你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1051_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d2d9e8928f382a3345269f7fd23b869e80791fe44dcc9e4b1cdf5175e79df9f9", "ja": "えっ？　わ、私が、なんですか？", "zh": "咦？我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1052_p", "source_sha256": "c85ba067b11337cdde58987e6370d65cb49c5c0bb8733d8cc0f0699fb691bfda", "ja": "風花は元看護師じゃないか。きっと星梨花のお父さんの\n大きな安心材料になると思う。一緒に来てくれるか？", "zh": "风花你以前是护理师对吧？如果星梨花的爸爸知道\n你会同行，一定也会放心许多。你可以一起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1053_041fuk", "source_sha256": "548f1799bc96840f16fe19c1f8c62516e38c5738ca1f6a5cf85bd74151c998f8", "ja": "あ……、もちろん、私でお役に立てるなら。\n未来ちゃん、一緒に頑張ろうね♪", "zh": "啊……当然可以，只要我能够帮上忙就好。\n未来，我们一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1054_014mir", "source_sha256": "73c3653ea819ec0411191ea4577dd59685b425c2c6d4599b58af3f21f57a3449", "ja": "わーい！　よろしくお願いします、風花さん♪", "zh": "耶──！拜托你了，风花姊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1055_028ari", "source_sha256": "4ffbf9b8db586d449a5e588202abe285ddb91e6686c35a6fb0c9f45aaa784226", "ja": "では、ありさは星梨花ちゃんの記念写真係、\nということでどうでしょう！？", "zh": "那么，亚利沙就负责帮星梨花\n拍纪念照怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1056_p", "source_sha256": "e5a7e9e3bf4afde889dfb7e9e8313446ffd7a7767b6f6b55adb8b272f7f209c2", "ja": "いや、それは……逆効果な気もするな。\nあんまり大勢で押しかけるのもどうかと思うし。", "zh": "不，我想那样……搞不好会造成反效果。\n毕竟成群结队地拜访人家也不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "69b42140c3f4a133c8b49e5f903a89d12acfa1202d456cfc1652d9787d8d2296", "ja": "よし、亜利沙と琴葉は登山の準備に専念してくれ。\n星梨花のお父さんの所へは、未来と風花と俺で行くよ。", "zh": "好，亚利沙跟琴叶就专心做登山的准备。\n星梨花爸爸那里，则由未来、风花跟我一起去拜访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1058_017kth", "source_sha256": "db4a0b264e0e99f7486bc95e5c1bdfbcc44bc8f5dc3ac5aa797e7be11c09dd54", "ja": "……わかりました。確かに、きちんとした準備があって\nこそですよね。任された責任、しっかりと果たします！", "zh": "……我知道了，做好万全准备的确才是根本。\n我会好好完成这个任务的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1059_028ari", "source_sha256": "53737cedc6b638752ed7c95007de9b15e0c57e45a4cda6a84722b851951efb48", "ja": "では……ありさも、\n万全の撮影準備を整えておきます！", "zh": "那么……亚利沙也会先做好\n拍摄的万全准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1060_022ser", "source_sha256": "2e0fca0d69e7baff62121f0f230552d56f3328c5f2427443d03320f70b3623b6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、みなさん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，还有大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1061_022ser", "source_sha256": "fa8f0486a7b315c2ea802a0788c0a44f5d8ac7377c1dd43a25cef57d82384a00", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nわたしのために、たくさん考えてくれて……。", "zh": "谢谢你们！\n为了我设想这么多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1062_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa378cd4e54ce98a372b70a072eab3d272be5e049b3942a6551cea381392f1ec", "ja": "気にしなくていいよ、星梨花！\nみんなで星を見ようって言い出したの、私だもん。", "zh": "你不用介意啦，星梨花！\n毕竟提出要一起去看星星的是我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1063_014mir", "source_sha256": "431d15ca97ffccfe652794e1f2b4660b53435987a920553d3b22b039544245fd", "ja": "それに、このメンバーで星の歌を歌うんだから。\nこのメンバーで一緒に見なくちゃだよね！", "zh": "而且，我们要合唱星星的歌曲，\n所以当然要所有人一起去看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1064_022ser", "source_sha256": "cff8c1f91a3a10a8dab5abef2b1da48c23789bd800ccf13b1bc5d47b5c38123d", "ja": "未来さん……。", "zh": "未来姊姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1065_022ser", "source_sha256": "dc1b6871eafd56721347768a746e93201797d12a0cfc0442ccb89c0fecc04726", "ja": "わたし、がんばります。みんなで星を見に行けるように\nわたしも、ちゃんとパパを説得します！", "zh": "我会加油的。\n为了能跟大家一起去看星星，我也会努力说服爸爸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1066_p", "source_sha256": "7cae61475b6802b84a401ebc5ba26dccc3a2404137d1b59f5f77498ba1475eae", "ja": "ありがとう、星梨花。本当は俺がしっかりしていれば\n済む話なんだけど……。", "zh": "谢谢你，星梨花。\n老实说如果我能更可靠一些，就没有这些问题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1067_p", "source_sha256": "80bbfd0e4fb2adeef03a4e7dffc52e3d1807af22837635fd630df1f29984561b", "ja": "ごめん、今は、みんなの力も当てにさせてもらうよ。\n頼りにしてるぞ、みんな！", "zh": "抱歉，现在就让我依靠大家的力量吧。\n靠你们了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0056_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0056_story_01_1068_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
